{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792388760, "covers_from": "2026-10-19T05:46:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-19T05:47:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792388820, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-19T05:46:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 64082, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我是開車者，常碰到行駛單行道時，腳踏車逆向騎來，我的認知，腳踏「車」屬於車輛，該如何改善與懲罰亂象？", "display_name": "大安代表 No.64,082", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T05:46:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 65923, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "把所有中文命名的幹線公車改掉應該以數字做為公車的名稱，寫中文對外國人來台北觀光很不友善站牌要加上英文", "display_name": "大安代表 No.65,923", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T05:46:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 51749, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "教育", "content": "如果公務員/教師機制不會特別福利鼓舞/薪資獎勵有能力的人，那就是鼓勵無能", "display_name": "信義代表 No.51,749", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-19T05:46:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53879, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "食安", "content": "營養午餐免費後還要秤廚餘，小學廚工阿姨們現在還要多處理廚餘很辛苦，應比照台南發放智慧廚餘機，減輕負擔", "display_name": "大安代表 Minchelle", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 65923, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.65,923", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 51749, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.51,749", "district": "xinyi", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 53879, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 Minchelle", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 67543, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "